  "notes": [
    "The signing set is Grandpa.CurrentSetId and GrandpaApi_grandpa_authorities at #118,636, B's parent; both hold the same set at B, as B changes none.",
    "The signers hint names precommit 1 (key 0) and precommit 0 (key 1), each signature checked with the light client's own check (grandpa.ts clientVerifies).",
    "childstate_getStorage returns the same word as the child proof. state_getChildReadProof served 8 items: the 6 main-trie items of childRoot.proof and the 2 child-trie items in slot.proof.",
    "The lock is the one deployments/v3-testnet.json records; the slot holds the commitment recomputed from its fields.",
    "A light client at the signing set whose latest header is below B imports B with this finality proof (B's parent is such a checkpoint); one that holds B already verifies it again and writes nothing."
  ]
